TEXT 256 -904 Left 5 ;This example shows a loadlflowcomputation for a whole day ( 24 hours )\nThe powerlost of lines and transformers are optimized  by\nvarying the active power output of the plant  \n===================================================================\n \nThe loadline is v(ll24h)\nThe powerunit input is v(kw24h)\nThe timewise switch off with line_LF 7 ( and the cutoff from gen2 ) is shown at v(on_24h)\nThe changing transformer tap setting to regulate the voltage level is shown at v(ru_24h)\nThe changing voltage value with inductive compensation ( kd1 ) is shown at v(q_24h)
TEXT -992 -872 Left 2 ;In loadflow circuits it is better to set the tolerances to appropriate values !!
TEXT -904 -832 Left 2 ;voltage and powerfactor for loadflowcomputation
